    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48832" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Θησεῖον</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>temple of Theseus</i>, a
			sanctuary (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄσυλον</span>) for criminals and
			slaves, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				1312
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				567
			</span></i>:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Θησέον</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Pherecr.
				49
			</span></i> (cf. <u>Et.Gen.</u>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Θησεῖα</span></b> , τά, <i>festival of Theseus</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pl.</u>
				627
			</span></i>:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Θησέα</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				1029.78
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv B.C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θησεῖον</span></b> , τό, <i>holewort, Corydalis densiflora</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				7.12.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				21.107
			</span></i>.</div>
